{"title":"Astral Saw","slug":"Astral_Saw","hero":{"file":"Astral_saw.webp","width":400,"height":347},"pageid":4557,"revid":20247,"timestamp":"2025-10-30T14:43:11Z","lastEditor":"Tetrahedronal","categories":["Infobox_templates"],"infobox":{"type":"Tool","fields":[{"label":"name","value":"Astral Saw"},{"label":"unboxed_image","value":"Astral saw.png"},{"label":"shop","value":"The Monstrous Manor"},{"label":"price","value":"10.25k Candy(for the Hardened Moon Rod)"},{"label":"power","value":"2"},{"label":"distance","value":"25 studs"},{"label":"loop_range","value":"0.7"},{"label":"version_added","value":"1.93.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<p><br>\n<i>A saw forged from stardust itself. Cut through wood as if the cosmos were guiding your hand.”</i>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Astral Saw</b> was added in the <b>2025 Halloween Event</b>. It is obtainable by placing a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hardened_Moon_Rod/\">Hardened Moon Rod</a> and a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Moon_Shard/\">Waxing Crescent Moon Shard</a> at the altar at the top of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor/\">The Manor</a>.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>"}
